{"id":4472,"date":"2025-06-27T07:52:30","date_gmt":"2025-06-27T07:52:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4472"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:04:56","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:04:56","slug":"vi-shopee-pay-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/vi-shopee-pay-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"V\u00ed Shopee Pay l\u00e0 g\u00ec? C\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00ed Shopee Pay si\u00eau \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"UcpPdPddbokNaDxw3OclA3s2gxb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J66hdQuC4o07GIxqWMzlDA1Ggrg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed ShopeePay l\u00e0 v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a Shopee, cho ph\u00e9p thanh to\u00e1n nhanh, an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i cho c\u1ea3 online l\u1eabn offline. V\u1edbi h\u01a1n 10 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t t\u1ea3i, ShopeePay h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n, thanh to\u00e1n h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n, qu\u00e9t m\u00e3 t\u1ea1i c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng. V\u00ed li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng l\u1edbn v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean cung c\u1ea5p \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i nh\u01b0 ho\u00e0n xu, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, freeship. Tham kh\u1ea3o ngay b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft ngay b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital.<\/strong><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ItjRdYA4Zo27kXxL8jrl7Q0Og9n\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. V\u00ed Shopee Pay l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4473\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4473\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4473\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/456.png\" alt=\"V\u00ed Shopee Pay l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/456.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/456-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/456-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/456-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/456-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4473\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">V\u00ed Shopee Pay l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LAVrdnml7oYvIIxsa2Olk1J2gKg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed ShopeePay l\u00e0 v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed t\u00edch h\u1ee3p trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i Shopee, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng thanh to\u00e1n tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng, an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i. V\u00ed h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng Shopee, h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n \u0111i\u1ec7n\/n\u01b0\u1edbc, n\u1ea1p \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e9, mua h\u00e0ng offline t\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec3m b\u00e1n li\u00ean k\u1ebft&#8230;<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ux9Md8I8ToxplQxdaAVlylyGgbe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ShopeePay kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap r\u00fat ng\u1eafn thao t\u00e1c mua h\u00e0ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 ho\u00e0n xu, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-McXBdTsNgoyiwLxJ2TplvaOpglf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. L\u1ee3i \u00edch c\u1ee7a Shopee Pay<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTgkdbiSpoWNEjx45sflWorngJc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">ShopeePay mang \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng trong c\u1ea3 thanh to\u00e1n online v\u00e0 offline. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u1ebft, v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed n\u00e0y cho ph\u00e9p thanh to\u00e1n nhanh ch\u00f3ng, ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c \u2013 t\u1eeb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee, h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n \u0111i\u1ec7n n\u01b0\u1edbc, n\u1ea1p th\u1ebb \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e9 xem phim.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTgkdbiSpoWNEjx45sflWorngJc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, ShopeePay th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, ho\u00e0n xu, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i theo d\u1ecbp. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, t\u00ednh n\u0103ng b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u00fa tr\u1ecdng v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 nh\u01b0 m\u00e3 PIN, OTP, x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c v\u00e2n tay ho\u1eb7c Face ID, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o an to\u00e0n tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i cho m\u1ecdi giao d\u1ecbch. ShopeePay c\u0169ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng v\u1edbi h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba, gi\u00fap n\u1ea1p \u2013 r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n linh ho\u1ea1t. Ngo\u00e0i ra, v\u00ed c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng offline nh\u01b0 si\u00eau th\u1ecb, qu\u00e1n \u0103n, c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i th\u00f4ng qua h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c qu\u00e9t m\u00e3 QR, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m thanh to\u00e1n to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MaR4dPXNqoeUwVxQ4jelKbo4gRg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MbOQd0OSVofuKrxMp2ylogYOgxb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">3. Shopee Pay ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQeTdzktwoJ5kux2J57lwu6dg2g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch chi ti\u1ebft h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch <strong>ShopeePay ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/strong>, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 quy tr\u00ecnh t\u1eeb l\u00fac c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ebfn khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. K\u00edch ho\u1ea1t v\u00e0 li\u00ean k\u1ebft ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Alx7dqDQGobh3RxWKu8lN7KJgjd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ea3i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ShopeePay (tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 AirPay) v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n. ShopeePay hi\u1ec7n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba l\u1edbn t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam nh\u01b0 Vietcombank, BIDV, VietinBank, ACB, TPBank, Sacombank\u2026 Vi\u1ec7c li\u00ean k\u1ebft y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Internet Banking \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt giao d\u1ecbch.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>2. N\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0o v\u00ed ShopeePay<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ENkddF9YMo1NgBxpb8slrQXcgMh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi li\u00ean k\u1ebft th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp t\u1eeb t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0o v\u00ed ShopeePay. S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 trong v\u00ed \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\u00e1n cho nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1c nhau. Ngo\u00e0i ra, ShopeePay c\u0169ng cho ph\u00e9p r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb v\u00ed tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>3. Thanh to\u00e1n tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn tr\u00ean Shopee<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EaDadYyMUoFU9oxELuwlGDzigog\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi b\u1ea1n mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean s\u00e0n TM\u0110T Shopee, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n b\u1eb1ng ShopeePay. Sau khi x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 PIN v\u00ed ShopeePay (ho\u1eb7c x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c b\u1eb1ng v\u00e2n tay\/khu\u00f4n m\u1eb7t) \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t thanh to\u00e1n. Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c n\u00e0y gi\u00fap r\u00fat ng\u1eafn th\u1eddi gian so v\u1edbi chuy\u1ec3n kho\u1ea3n ho\u1eb7c thanh to\u00e1n khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng (COD), \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng k\u00e8m theo nhi\u1ec1u \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i nh\u01b0 ho\u00e0n xu, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>4. Thanh to\u00e1n offline t\u1ea1i c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KOsWdSMpoopIcNxi5mzlASHJgKd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">ShopeePay kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n trong mua s\u1eafm online. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng v\u00ed \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\u00e1n t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng v\u1eadt l\u00fd nh\u01b0 si\u00eau th\u1ecb, nh\u00e0 h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e1n c\u00e0 ph\u00ea, ti\u1ec7m thu\u1ed1c\u2026 ch\u1ec9 b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch qu\u00e9t m\u00e3 QR code do \u0111i\u1ec3m b\u00e1n cung c\u1ea5p. Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y di\u1ec5n ra r\u1ea5t nhanh v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ti\u1ec1n m\u1eb7t hay qu\u1eb9t th\u1ebb.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>5. B\u1ea3o m\u1eadt &amp; qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd giao d\u1ecbch<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LdLYdChv5owGt2xc8j4lgjCIgLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 giao d\u1ecbch tr\u00ean ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 b\u1eb1ng nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt: m\u00e3 PIN, OTP, x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c sinh tr\u1eafc h\u1ecdc. Ngo\u00e0i ra, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ecbch s\u1eed giao d\u1ecbch, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd chi ti\u00eau h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng, \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n thanh to\u00e1n, v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o khi c\u00f3 ph\u00e1t sinh giao d\u1ecbch<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G7FFdZkaKoIPiNxTdxGlgnX8ghb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>T\u00f3m l\u1ea1i:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Va5DdT8naodjyXx7wfblXeEagok\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">ShopeePay ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u1ed5ng thanh to\u00e1n \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed th\u00f4ng minh \u2013 t\u1eeb li\u00ean k\u1ebft ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng, n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n, thanh to\u00e1n online l\u1eabn offline, \u0111\u1ebfn ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nhanh ch\u00f3ng, an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 t\u00edch h\u1ee3p ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i Shopee.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Va5DdT8naodjyXx7wfblXeEagok\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4474\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4474\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4474\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/523.png\" alt=\"Shopee Pay ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/523.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/523-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/523-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/523-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/523-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4474\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Shopee Pay ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"UcpPdPddbokNaDxw3OclA3s2gxb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UryvdA3pvosrDnxJFlUls5Z3gZf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. C\u00e1ch k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t v\u00e0 li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u00ed Shopee Pay v\u1edbi Shopee<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H00XdoYV4oa6hdxj3izlqxV2g9d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea3i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ShopeePay<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JC0bddqaIom9LVxXkCglVSe5gkd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Truy c\u1eadp App Store (iOS) ho\u1eb7c CH Play (Android).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GE3TdzeDRoAv26xyUwFliDAmg9e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ShopeePay (tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 AirPay).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EQCSdb8R4oPMoYxJRyTlJFONgIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp b\u1eb1ng s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OZVcdHYIyojRRMxcIPnlL83Kgdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>D\u00f9ng s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i tr\u00f9ng v\u1edbi s\u1ed1 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o ShopeePay.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MXHfdtGMqoI8yrxk5cTlPE9WgAh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X\u00e1c minh s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i b\u1eb1ng m\u00e3 OTP g\u1eedi v\u1ec1 SMS.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0ROdbRwComjhJxvniHlaQHTgLd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3:<\/strong> <strong>Li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u00ed v\u1edbi Shopee<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UDA0d5eYuozw3Fxg03DlK2yOgkc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee, ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c T\u00f4i &gt; ShopeePay.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NqKGd9vCQoMQ0XxL03al1K5pgWg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1ea5n K\u00edch ho\u1ea1t ngay v\u00e0 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi v\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp b\u1eb1ng c\u00f9ng s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kjbad7ZhyoSJRqxvZ4El3C3TgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4:<\/strong> Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00ed ShopeePay<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtJmdoICrotXqmxntIClHzaGgte\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1eb7t m\u00e3 PIN g\u1ed3m 6 ch\u1eef s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 v\u00ed.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Meied5q0WorEUOxNpqXlLGQAgWb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u (CCCD\/CMND n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft cho b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YI1cd9kzloXHTLxxS2ElPFc2gKg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SvIQd9VYEobs6Qx4zCylviU8gQh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ShopeePay, v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c Li\u00ean k\u1ebft ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QYdhdNUDmo3INrxPL5BlDF5Fguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng mu\u1ed1n li\u00ean k\u1ebft, nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn b\u1eb1ng OTP t\u1eeb ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HxS8dmiXGovQuLxgpV5ln7ZPgEc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZQ9bdv5GroCSo8xAFhSl8MMRgNh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ec9 nh\u1eefng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd Internet Banking m\u1edbi c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1edbi ShopeePay.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OA5Jd8Mp7odF3vx4PRLlOOgngtb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u1ea1n n\u00ean d\u00f9ng s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i gi\u1ed1ng nhau cho c\u1ea3 Shopee v\u00e0 ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh li\u00ean k\u1ebft di\u1ec5n ra nhanh ch\u00f3ng, kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb l\u1ed7i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KTszd5GTwoVKh9xZs61lIxO8gDf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CoAydD0eSoythbxPZmQl2IiFgsg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">5. \u01afu \u0111\u00e3i khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng V\u00ed Shopee Pay<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4475\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4475\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4475\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/121.png\" alt=\"\u01afu \u0111\u00e3i khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng V\u00ed Shopee Pay\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/121.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/121-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/121-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/121-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/121-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4475\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u01afu \u0111\u00e3i khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng V\u00ed Shopee Pay<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R58ad0e5UoPDYuxOZvVl7OSwgmd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"UcpPdPddbokNaDxw3OclA3s2gxb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R58ad0e5UoPDYuxOZvVl7OSwgmd\">Khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00ed ShopeePay, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadn nhi\u1ec1u \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u01b0 m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n, ho\u00e0n xu khi thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng Shopee, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, c\u00f9ng lo\u1ea1t khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i khi thanh to\u00e1n t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c. Ngo\u00e0i ra, ShopeePay th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean tung ra c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i theo m\u00f9a ho\u1eb7c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m t\u1ed1i \u0111a chi ph\u00ed khi mua s\u1eafm tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn l\u1eabn ngo\u1ea1i tuy\u1ebfn.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R4hQdvwc8orKiBxqZbxltMV0gIc\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng V\u00ed ShopeePay mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng khi mua s\u1eafm v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng Shopee c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 li\u00ean k\u1ebft. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i ch\u00ednh d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean th\u00f4ng tin m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>1. M\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 khi thanh to\u00e1n<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li>Gi\u1ea3m t\u1edbi 100K cho l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u thanh to\u00e1n b\u1eb1ng V\u00ed ShopeePay v\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 0 \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/li>\n<li>Nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 kh\u00e1c, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: gi\u1ea3m 3% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 50K), gi\u1ea3m 10% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 15K) cho \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng to\u00e0n s\u00e0n ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01a1n FreeShip Xtra, gi\u1ea3m 50% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 10K) cho \u0111\u01a1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea3m 5% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 100K) v\u00e0o c\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd s\u0103n sale (0h, 9h, 12h, 21h).<\/li>\n<li>M\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 50% \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng, gi\u00fap ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m chi ph\u00ed mua s\u1eafm.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>2. Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nh\u1eadn c\u00e1c m\u00e3 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 30K\/m\u00e3) khi thanh to\u00e1n qua ShopeePay, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 ShopeePay Day (ng\u00e0y 25-27 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng).<\/li>\n<li><strong>V\u00ed d\u1ee5:<\/strong> 2 m\u00e3 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n k\u00e8m combo \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i 180K khi k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t v\u00ed.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div><strong>3. Ho\u00e0n xu (Shopee Xu)<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-number2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SvXDdQJ1ooU8ggxRsEKlUztdgbd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ho\u00e0n xu khi thanh to\u00e1n h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n, n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, mua v\u00e9 xem phim, \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n qua ShopeeFood, ho\u1eb7c mua v\u00e9 m\u00e1y bay.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MJb7d9W8xoti8rxvfHblHZU3gLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>V\u00ed d\u1ee5: Ho\u00e0n 15K cho l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u thanh to\u00e1n qua QR Pay ho\u1eb7c ho\u00e0n 50% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 120 xu) cho \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng Shopee Mall t\u1eeb 100K trong c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch nh\u01b0 ShopeePay Day.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div><strong>4. \u01afu \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li>Thanh to\u00e1n t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c nh\u01b0 ShopeeFood, The Coffee House, Ocha, Vntrip, BHD, K+, FPT Play, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c qu\u00e1n ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn ShopeePay qua t\u00ednh n\u0103ng Scan &amp; Pay Voucher.<\/li>\n<li>Gi\u1ea3m 20% khi s\u1ea1c qu\u00e9t QR qua ShopeePay t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div><strong>5. \u01afu \u0111\u00e3i khi li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng Super Shopee Platinum (VPBank), nh\u1eadn ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n 10% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 400K\/th\u00e1ng) cho giao d\u1ecbch tr\u00ean Shopee v\u00e0 ShopeeFood, ho\u00e0n 2% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 200K\/th\u00e1ng) cho \u0103n u\u1ed1ng, si\u00eau th\u1ecb, Grab, Be, v\u00e0 0.1% kh\u00f4ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n cho giao d\u1ecbch kh\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<li>T\u1eb7ng 4 m\u00e3 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n\/th\u00e1ng (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 30K\/m\u00e3) cho \u0111\u01a1n t\u1eeb 300K v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n 50% (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 100K xu) v\u00e0o th\u00e1ng sinh nh\u1eadt.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div><strong>6. \u01afu \u0111\u00e3i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u1edbi<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li>Nh\u1eadn ngay combo \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 300K khi k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t v\u00ed, bao g\u1ed3m: gi\u1ea3m 100K cho h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n mua h\u00e0ng, 15K cho thanh to\u00e1n QR Pay l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u, v\u00e0 2 m\u00e3 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n.<\/li>\n<li>M\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m 80K cho l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u thanh to\u00e1n b\u1eb1ng ShopeePay.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ATVqdZdY1oV7WDxz0WllzKx6gvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G5JXdwtnToTH0cxyVqXlQtbZgtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXOPdAuOgol1OnxtYohlMlpWgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpHVd1SMhogQu1xYqoYlnoXdgTc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9:<\/strong> 202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMXjd3GT2oX0nkx3DoglethDg1f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dn6Rd6UlhoMlY2xOQNvlcFWmgeh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I6OOdBPJZoXwYEx6maQlhTG8gbc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Su7kdp6hToBtAoxPREcl1fVJgpV\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>V\u00ed ShopeePay l\u00e0 v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a Shopee, cho ph\u00e9p thanh to\u00e1n nhanh, an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i cho c\u1ea3 online l\u1eabn offline. V\u1edbi h\u01a1n 10 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t t\u1ea3i, ShopeePay h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n, thanh to\u00e1n h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n, qu\u00e9t m\u00e3 t\u1ea1i c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng. V\u00ed li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e2n [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4766,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4472","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4472","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4472"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4472\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5155,"href":"https:\/\/lemondig